          "at": 0,
          "name": "The sleeping presence",
          "prompt": "A colossal sleeping horned demonic face made of polished black volcanic glass rises from a scarlet molten sea. Its eyelids are closed, its expression calm and ancient. Thousands of fine closely spaced ribs and minute scarlet crystal inlays cover the sweeping horns, brow and cheeks. Miniature obsidian spires, narrow pierced arcades, tiny staircases and delicate arched bridges form an intricate city on its crown and around its temples. A slender three-pronged crimson tower rises above the crown. Dense engraved grooves carry thin red reflections across glossy black surfaces. Small curling currents of luminous red lava flow between finely faceted black islands. A black eclipsed sun with a razor-thin scarlet rim sits at upper right. High-fidelity surreal digital environment, precise three-dimensional material relief, crisp cut-glass edges, fine parallel ridges, tiny sharp specular highlights, deep focus, saturated scarlet and jet black. Generous clear dark gaps between intricate layers. No haze, diffuse bloom, soft focus, watercolor, painted brushwork, lettering or people."
